# Auto-detect text files and normalise line endings. eol=lf checks text out
# with LF on every platform, core.autocrlf=true (Git for Windows) included:
# the plant contract and the digest snapshot hash checked-out bytes, so a
# CRLF checkout made every model's plant manifest stale. The per-type lines
# below inherit eol=lf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Source
*.py text
*.toml text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.md text
*.txt text
*.cfg text
*.ini text
*.json text

# MuJoCo models
*.xml text

# Images (binary)
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.svg text
